Generated by Jarvis v{{JARVIS_VERSION}}. Safe to edit.

Production patterns baked in:
  - SIGTERM/SIGALRM handlers (ECS graceful shutdown — prevents orphan tasks)
  - Structured JSON logs to stdout (CloudWatch picks up automatically)
  - Tenant isolation via JWT-derived tenantId on every request
  - Lazy boto3 clients (single instance per service, not per-request)
